        "right": "p0001-n0017-l0004"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0017-l0000",
      "p0001-n0017-l0001",
      "p0001-n0017-l0002",
      "p0001-n0017-l0003",
      "p0001-n0017-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "To consider how small Scottish fishing companies change their operations, we get the cost of fishing vessels, the number of fishing vessels, the quantity of fish caught and the price of fish. Based on these data, we forecast the company's net profit and help these Company analysis and decision making. At the same time, we analyze if a part of the fishery is transferred to another country and territorial sea."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000017",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0018-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0018-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0018-l0001",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0018-l0002"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0018-l0000",
      "p0001-n0018-l0001",
      "p0001-n0018-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "In terms of the highly-potential tough situation of small-scaled Scottish fishing companies, we propose a \u201ctwo-step\u201d developing strategy, including domestic and overseas corporate assets transformation."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000018",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0019-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0019-l0001"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0019-l0000",
      "p0001-n0019-l0001"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Finally, we discuss the advantages and disadvantages of the model and make scientific-based and practical suggestions for companies."
  },
